<title>UK: London silver fixes barely changed, quiet.</title>
<headline>London silver fixes barely changed, quiet.</headline>
<text>
<p>SILVER - Fixed at 436.35 cents vs 436.25 cents previously. Very quiet, steady.</p>
<p>GOLD - Holding firmer levels at $326.50/$326.90 up 30 cents.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Also steady at $424.00/$427.00, down $1.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Off early high at $202.00/$205.00, unchanged. Very tight, seen firming after short covering on Tocom.</p>
</text>
